subsection.p:
          In the Model, provide a "Selector" for the screen component:

public class HelloModel {     
    private String name; // this is the selector for a name STextfield     
    public void setName(String inName) {         
        name = inName;     
    }     
    public String getName() {         
        return name;     
    } 
}

          In the View, associate the model selector with the Swing component: 

STextField t = new STextField();         
t.setColumns(20);         
//associate this component with a variable called name in the model 
t.setSelector("name");          
add(t, BorderLayout.EAST);
